### 4. Create a sample calculation record (use token from step 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/import-records/save-calculation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_JWT_TOKEN_FROM_STEP_2

{
  "fromCountryId": 1,
  "toCountryId": 2,
  "productId": 1,
  "value": 1000.0,
  "year": 2024,
  "tariffRate": 5.5,
  "calculatedTariff": 55.0,
  "additionalFee": 2.0,
  "totalAdditionalFees": 20.0,
  "totalCost": 1075.0,
  "calculationType": "VALUE"
}

### 5. Test history again to see the created record
GET http://localhost:8080/api/import-records/history?page=0
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_JWT_TOKEN_FROM_STEP_2